From 0832d60fd5f609cc45425f59aa038d0dc180493a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: waydroid-nvidia project <ci@waydroid-nvidia>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:59:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] wayland-protocols: the protocol versions
 hwcomposer.waydroid uses, from wayland-protocols 1.49
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The patched hwcomposer (vendor-image/patches/hardware/waydroid) speaks newer
protocol versions than AOSP 13's copies: linux-dmabuf v4 feedback
(zwp_linux_dmabuf_feedback_v1, cross-GPU present), presentation-time,
viewporter, xdg-shell, pointer-constraints, tablet v2 and xdg-decoration.
Replace exactly these seven XMLs with the wayland-protocols 1.49 release
files (the release hwcomposer/pins.env pins; sha256 in its tarball).
Requests/events are only added, so every existing client keeps building.

适配 Android 17 基线：保留其已合入的 dmabuf 热拔插容错及隐式修饰符说明，
在既有 presentation 枚举描述和 xdg_surface 角色检查说明上合并 1.49 内容。
补齐 modifier 事件的 v4 废弃说明及 presented 析构语义；七份 XML 的协议版本
保持原补丁目标，未改动 ATV 的协议生成规则或其它扩展。

(cherry picked from commit 5a5e59973b799d6e670d1e1c8d8c1c5b654003e3)
